    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπυνθάνομαι</span></b>  (poet. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπεύθομαι</span> (q.v.)), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>search out by questioning, findout,</i>
			
